          "id": "60cc9b95f51e4362900ca24c",
          "questionNumber": 1,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>If the total winning amount in the year 2021 is Rs. 35,19,000 and the total winning amount in the year 2020 is Rs. 50,83,000 then, who has won the same amount by lucky draw in both the years?</p>",
