          ],
          "correctOptionId": "2",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Name</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2020 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2021 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sandeep</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">70&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sucheta</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Abhishek</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">45&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Bhupendero</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">40&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rajesh</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rishu</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">55&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">50&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>As in the question, all the data is in degrees and we know that the total degree value is 360 which will be the same in both years. So we will solve this question in direct proportion without the use of a degree.</p>\n\n<p>The ratio between the total winning amount in the year 2020 and 2021:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5083000 ∶&nbsp;3519000</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5083 ∶&nbsp;3519</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 221 ∶&nbsp;153</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 13 ∶&nbsp;9</p>\n\n<p>The person who has won the lucky draw amount in the reciprocal ratio of 13 ∶&nbsp;9 in 2020 and 2021, he has won the same amount in both years:</p>\n\n<p><strong>The ratio of winning amount in the year 2020 and 2021:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Sandeep = 65 ∶&nbsp;70 =&nbsp;13 ∶&nbsp;14</p>\n\n<p>Sucheta = 60 ∶&nbsp;75 =&nbsp;4 ∶&nbsp;5</p>\n\n<p>Abhishek = 45 ∶&nbsp;65 =&nbsp;9 ∶&nbsp;13</p>\n\n<p>Bhupendero = 75 ∶&nbsp;40 =&nbsp;15 ∶&nbsp;8</p>\n\n<p>Rajesh = 60 ∶&nbsp;60 =&nbsp;1 ∶&nbsp;1</p>\n\n<p>Rishu = 55 ∶&nbsp;50 =&nbsp;11 ∶&nbsp;10</p>\n\n<p>The person who has won the lucky draw amount in the reciprocal ratio of 13 ∶&nbsp;9 in 2020 and 2021 is Abhishek and his winning ratio in the year 2021 is to 2022 is 9 ∶&nbsp;13.</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;</strong><strong> Abhishek has won the same amount by lucky draw in both years.</strong></p>",
