          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Name</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2020 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2021 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sandeep</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">70&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sucheta</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Abhishek</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">45&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Bhupendero</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">40&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rajesh</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rishu</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">55&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">50&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Average = (Total sum of all numbers)/(Number of item&nbsp;in the set)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The total amount won by the lucky draw in the year 2021 is 50% more than the year 2020.</p>\n\n<p>So, the ratio of the amount won by lucky draw in the year 2020 and 2021 = 100 ∶&nbsp;150</p>\n\n<p>The winning amount of Rishu in the year 2021 = 135000</p>\n\n<p>The winning amount of all of these in the year 2021 = (135000/50&deg;) &times; 360&deg;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; <span style=\"\">9,72,000</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">The winning amount of all of these in the year 2020 = (972000/150) &times; 100</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">6,48,000</span></p>\n\n<p>The total amount won by Sandeep, Abhishek, and Sucheta in 2020 (in degree):</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 65 + 45 +60</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 170</p>\n\n<p>The total amount won by Sandeep, Abhishek, and Sucheta in 2020 (in Rs.):</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 648000 &times; (170/360)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 306000</p>\n\n<p>The average of total amount won by Sandeep, Abhishek, and Sucheta in 2020:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 306000/3</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 102000</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;</strong><strong> The average total amount won by Sandeep, Abhishek and Sucheta in 2020 is Rs. 1,02,000.</strong></p>",
