          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Name</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2020 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2021 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sandeep</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">70&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sucheta</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Abhishek</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">45&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Bhupendero</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">40&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rajesh</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rishu</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">55&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">50&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Bhupendra won Rs. 86250 in a lucky draw in the year 2020 = 86250</p>\n\n<p>The value given in the pie chart of lucky draw won by Bhupendero in the year 2020 = 75&deg;</p>\n\n<p>Then, 10% of the total amount won by Rajesh in the year 2020 as per pie chart = 60&deg;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (86250/75) &times; 60 &times; 10%</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;&rArr; 6900</p>\n\n<p>Bhupendra won Rs 86250 in a lucky draw in the year 2021 = 84400</p>\n\n<p>The value given in the pie chart of lucky draw won by Bhupendero in the year 2021 = 40&deg;</p>\n\n<p>Then, 5% of the total amount won by Sandeep in the year 2021 as per pie chart = 70&deg;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (84400/40) &times; 70 &times; 5%</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 7385</p>\n\n<p>Required Difference = 7385 - 6900</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 485</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;</strong><strong> The difference between 10% of the total amount won by Rajesh in the year 2020 and 5% of the amount won by Sandeep in the year 2021 is Rs. 485.</strong></p>",
