          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Name</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2020 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Winning amount in 2021 (in degree)</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sandeep</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">70&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Sucheta</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Abhishek</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">45&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">65&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Bhupendero</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">75&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">40&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rajesh</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">60&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rishu</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">55&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">50&deg;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:78px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:90px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:72px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>360&deg;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The amount of lucky draw won by Rishu in the year 2021 = 25500</p>\n\n<p>The value given in the pie chart of lucky draw won by Rishu in the year 2021 = 50&deg;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 50&deg; = 25500</p>\n\n<p>The total amount won by all the people in the year 2021:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 360&deg; = (25500/50) &times; 360</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 183600</p>\n\n<p>The amount of lucky draw won by Sucheta in the year 2020 = 29000</p>\n\n<p>The value given in the pie chart of lucky draw won by Sucheta in the year 2020 = 60&deg;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 60&deg; = 29000</p>\n\n<p>The total amount won by all the people in the year 2020:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 360&deg; = (29000/60) &times; 360</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 29000 &times; 6</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 174000</p>\n\n<p>Required sum = 183600 + 174000</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 357600</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;</strong><strong> The total amount won by all the people in both the years together is Rs. 3,57,600.</strong></p>",
