          "id": "6012620a7c9b1a82aad162a5",
          "questionNumber": 6,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p align=\"left\">If India&rsquo;s state are mapped on chart of world rice production, then what will be the value of angle subtended by West Bengal on the chat?</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "36&deg;",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "10.08&deg;",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "11.86&deg;",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "5.98&deg;",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "42&deg;",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "2",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p align=\"left\">We know that sum of all the values (a and b) in each chart equal to 100.</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">So, we have</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">3a + 8a + 7a + 4a + 3a = 100 &rArr; 25a = 100 &rArr; a = 4</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Similarly, 2b + 6b + 5b + 4b + 3b = 100 &rArr; 20b = 100 &rArr; b = 5</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Now it&rsquo;s given in question that rice production in Kerala is 21 million metric tons</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Kerala produce 4b% of rice in India that is 20% rice</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">So. We have 20% of rice in India = 21 million metric tons</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Rice production in India = (21 &times; 100)/20 = 105 million metric tons</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Now rice production in India is 7a% &rArr; 28% of total rice production in world</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Therefore, rice production in world = (105 &times; 100)/28 = 375 million metric tons</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Rice production in West Bengal = 10% of 105 = 10.50 million metric tons</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">Therefore angle subtended by West Bengal on chart of world rice production =&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\">(10.50/375) &times; 360 = 10.08&deg;</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
